-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §133 ימי עבודה, שעות עבודה ובסיס משרה: a
-- full-time kindergarten teacher works five days a week; the kindergarten's
-- hours are 7:55–14:00 Sunday to Thursday and 7:55–12:45 on Friday; and the
-- base of her full position grows accordingly.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `133 ימי עבודה, שעות עבודה ובסיס משרה`

@ref akn:art_133__para_a
`a kindergarten teacher's working days in a full position` MEANS 5

-- (ב): the hours, in minutes after midnight.
@ref akn:art_133__para_b akn:art_133__para_b/p2 akn:art_133__para_b/p3
DECLARE `kindergarten day` IS ONE OF `Sunday to Thursday`, `Friday`

GIVEN d IS A `kindergarten day`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the kindergarten's hours that day` d IS
    IF d EQUALS `Friday`
    THEN ((12 TIMES 60 PLUS 45) MINUS (7 TIMES 60 PLUS 55)) DIVIDED BY 60
    ELSE ((14 TIMES 60) MINUS (7 TIMES 60 PLUS 55)) DIVIDED BY 60

-- (ג): the full position's base grows "accordingly"; by how much is not
-- printed, so the new base is an input.
@ref akn:art_133__para_c
ASSUME `a kindergarten teacher's new full-position base` IS A NUMBER

-- 6 h 5 m on a weekday, 4 h 50 m on Friday.
#ASSERT `the kindergarten's hours that day` `Sunday to Thursday` EQUALS 365 DIVIDED BY 60
#ASSERT `the kindergarten's hours that day` `Friday` EQUALS 290 DIVIDED BY 60
